# CR 601: cast a creature spell. Two Forests pay {1}{G} -- one for the
# green pip, one for the generic -- and Grizzly Bears becomes an object on
# the stack (CR 405.2, 601.2i). resolvestack resolves it through
# APIPermanentCreature (CastSpell picks that API because the card is a
# creature); permanentEffect just moves it to the battlefield
# (CR 608.2m/608.3g) -- the same zone-change ETB that already grants
# SummonSick, since nothing about a cast spell's resolution is special-cased
# there.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 G
tapformana human 3 G
queue paygeneric G
castspell human 1
resolvestack
